Dependencies
------------

Go and npm dependencies are fetched at build time and keep their own
licenses (MIT, BSD and Apache-2.0 style; see api/go.mod and
web/package.json). None is vendored in this repository.

Model providers
---------------

Draftmind calls models through OpenRouter (https://openrouter.ai), including
TypeSafe's Jev models. Their use is subject to each provider's terms; no
model weights or outputs are included here beyond small recorded responses
used as test fixtures.
